cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "v0.2.0 - Phases, end positions, and Git-free includes"
title: "ScienceLogo: a language for scientific workflows in the AI era"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Riccardo
    family-names: Boero
    email: ribo@nilu.no
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7468-9096"
abstract: >-
  ScienceLogo is a Logo-inspired language for scientific workflows in the AI era.
  Its design pairs readable procedures with checkable scientific obligations
  and traceable evidence so people can understand and supervise AI-assisted work.
keywords:
  - scientific workflows
  - reproducible research
  - human oversight
  - artificial intelligence
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ScienceLogo/Language"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23597749
